  "detail_text": "The purpose of this effort is to provide design/report documents, installation, programming, and certification to repair the fire protection systems at Malmstrom AFB facilities and Missile Alert Facilities to comply with current Air Force Design Guide, Global Strike/Materials Command Design Directives, Base Standards, and referenced publications. The intent is to provide an upgraded system that fully complies with current USAF design standards, Unified Facilities Criteria (UFC).",
